{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ctfkit",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/compliancetf/ctfkit",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ctf.lock.unwrapped",
              "name": "lock.unwrapped",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The lock file installs an upstream provider that bypasses a wrapped type"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The lock file installs an upstream provider that bypasses a wrapped type"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The lock file installs an upstream provider that bypasses a wrapped type. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#lock-file-rules",
                "markdown": "**The lock file installs an upstream provider that bypasses a wrapped type.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.lock.unwrapped\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#lock-file-rules)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#lock-file-rules",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "lock"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.0"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "ctf.lock.unwrapped",
          "level": "warning",
          "kind": "fail",
          "message": {
            "text": "Lock entry registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/google-beta manages google resources outside the compliance.tf wrapper registry.compliance.tf/compliancetf/google"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": ".terraform.lock.hcl"
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "provider[\"registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/google-beta\"]",
                  "kind": "provider"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "ctfkitFindingHash/v1": "13aa4659922e7ad952c3908e0cec259e97704d6a377c4dc4964562a7a82d408a"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ctf.schema": "1.0",
            "ctf.stage": "pre_plan",
            "ctf.controlIds": [],
            "ctf.frameworks": [],
            "ctf.preventive": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
